#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/nutanix/nutanix.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/nutanix/nutanix.rst:7
msgid ""
"Nutanix Prism Element simplifies datacenter infrastructure by integrating "
"server and storage resources allowing applications to run at scale. "
"|morpheus| enhances Nutanix resources by allowing efficient and seamless "
"deployment of virtualized or containerized applications, management of "
"existing brownfield resources in Nutanix Clouds, pricing and cost tracking, "
"and monitoring of running workloads."
msgstr ""
"Nutanix Prism Element simplifies datacenter infrastructure by integrating "
"server y storage recursos allowing applications to run at scale. |morpheus| "
"enhances Nutanix recursos by allowing efficient y seamless deployment of "
"virtualized o containerized applications, management of existente brownfield"
" recursos in Nutanix Clouds, pricing y cost tracking, y monitoring of "
"running workloads."

